# Revert pressed on the way down, 12 ticks (0.1 s) before the wheels meet the ramp: it counts on the
# landing (combo.revertBufferTicks 20). Kickflip off the vert ramp, lands fakie at 356, reverts on that
# tick: "Kickflip + Revert" (x2). Before the buffer, a press before the landing did nothing.
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
tap flip+left 212
tap revert 344
run 600
expect event land{fakie=true} within 354..358
expect event revert within 354..358
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Revert,multiplier=2} within 362..394
expect no event bail
